Value TOTAL_PREFIXES (\d+)
Value ACTIVE_PREFIXES (\d+)
Value PROTO (\S+)
Value TOTAL (\d+|-)
Value ACTIVE (\d+|-)
Value ADDED (\d+|-)
Value DELETED (\d+|-)
Value FREED (\d+|-)

Start
  ^\s*Total\s+prefixes:\s+${TOTAL_PREFIXES}\s+Active\s+prefixes:\s+${ACTIVE_PREFIXES}\s*$$
  ^\s*Proto\s+[Rr]outes?\s+[Aa]ctive\s+[Aa]dded\s+[Dd]eleted(?:\s+[Ff]reed)?\s*$$
  ^\s*${PROTO}\s+${TOTAL}\s+${ACTIVE}\s+${ADDED}\s+${DELETED}(?:\s+${FREED})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*-+$$
  ^\s*$$
